# Live Spectate: one static page serves every code.
#
# The site is a Next.js static export, so /w/<CODE> has no route to generate —
# there is no finite list of codes. A 200 rewrite serves /w for any code and the
# page reads the code from the URL, which keeps the link pretty (the code IS the
# path segment) without giving up the static build.
/w/*  /w  200
